WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.329
ALEX: Or it's what you say when
you want

00:00:02.329 --> 00:00:04.658
ALEX: the money and the steering
wheel.

00:00:04.723 --> 00:00:06.283
JAMIE: Both things can be true at
once.

00:00:06.463 --> 00:00:07.795
RUFUS: Welcome to the IPO.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.855
ALEX: There's also the question of
who the selling

00:00:10.855 --> 00:00:13.701
ALEX: stockholders are. The
announcement says some shares are

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:16.548
ALEX: sold by selling
stockholders, not just Anthropic
itself.

00:00:16.658 --> 00:00:18.792
RUFUS: Which means some existing
stockholders are selling at

00:00:18.792 --> 00:00:20.926
RUFUS: eighty-three dollars.
That's not a scandal — it's

00:00:20.926 --> 00:00:23.059
RUFUS: how venture capital works —
but it does

00:00:23.059 --> 00:00:25.193
RUFUS: tell you something about
who believed in Anthropic

00:00:25.193 --> 00:00:27.327
RUFUS: at what price.
